; The fire backdrop (src/bd_fire.c builds the sky, the ground's glow and drives the lights): a canyon of fire walls
; receding to a burning horizon under a sky of smoke lit from below, embers storming up through it. Seen from a little
; above the ground, the horizon two thirds up the screen, as the rivers recede.

